<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on basket of H.K. stocks.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on basket of H.K. stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Friday it has launched 1.2 billion American-style call warrants on a basket of red-chips, blue-chips and Chinese enterprises H-shares.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd	   0.01 shares</p>
<p> HSBC Holdings Plc			0.01 shares</p>
<p> First Pacific Co Ltd		   0.06 shares</p>
<p> Ng Fung Hong Ltd			 0.10 shares</p>
<p> Guangshen Railway Co Ltd	     0.10 shares</p>
<p> Anhui Expressway Co Ltd		0.10 shares</p>
<p> Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd		0.10 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$5.4360	PREMIUM	 17.26 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.0938	GEARING	 5.79x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  26.JAN.98	PAYDATE	 25.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  27.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$5.4360	EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT THE</p>
<p>DISCRETION OF ISSUER.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
